{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the Rain</strong> is a first-person horror game with a realistic tone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a disappearance, you play as a student from Linjiang High School who sneaks into the campus alone late at night. As you explore the once-familiar school now shrouded in mystery, you begin to uncover hidden secrets, learn about the lives of students and teachers, and gradually approach the truth behind what happened...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Interaction</strong>: You will explore various areas of the school, search for tools and keys, and interact with clues to piece together the story. <br>(<i>Due to limited development time and resources, interactions are currently presented primarily through text.</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you'll experience a tense atmosphere filled with moments of dread and psychological unease.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892800?t=1754787419","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892800?t=1754787419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892800/4f77c3fd0db542fa9eeb7fcfabcf3d014cf30ac9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754787419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892800/4f77c3fd0db542fa9eeb7fcfabcf3d014cf30ac9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754787419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[]